{"id":"a2393ecde85db745","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-prewellordering.md","title":"非单调归纳的预良序唯一性定理","display":"thm-prewellordering — 非单调归纳的预良序唯一性定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-prewellordering","aliases":["18-thm-prewellordering"],"display":"thm-prewellordering — 非单调归纳的预良序唯一性定理","depends_on":["[[18-df-inductive-norm]]","[[18-df-stage-comparison]]","[[18-df-prewellordering]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Theorem 13.2.2","source_printed_pages":"337–338","source_pdf_pages":"345–346","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"已核 Theorem 13.2.2 的全部证明，并核对以下集合大小阶段版本"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-prewellordering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-prewellordering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prewellordering — 非单调归纳的预良序唯一性定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03fd31ede57cedbe\" href=\"?note=03fd31ede57cedbe\" title=\"18-df-inductive-norm\">18-df-inductive-norm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"267d66ca73221e94\" href=\"?note=267d66ca73221e94\" title=\"18-df-stage-comparison\">18-df-stage-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b8684802726abc97\" href=\"?note=b8684802726abc97\" title=\"18-df-prewellordering\">18-df-prewellordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Theorem 13.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"337–338"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"345–346"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"已核 Theorem 13.2.2 的全部证明，并核对以下集合大小阶段版本"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma\">\\(P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03fd31ede57cedbe\" href=\"?note=03fd31ede57cedbe\" title=\"18-df-inductive-norm\">18-df-inductive-norm</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma\">\\(R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"267d66ca73221e94\" href=\"?note=267d66ca73221e94\" title=\"18-df-stage-comparison\">18-df-stage-comparison</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b8684802726abc97\" href=\"?note=b8684802726abc97\" title=\"18-df-prewellordering\">18-df-prewellordering</a>。量化的候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\">\\(R,S\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 上的二元关系；不假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 单调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega\n(P_\\Gamma,R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega\n(P_\\Gamma,R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall P\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\\forall R,S\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega^2)\\quad\n\\Bigl(\\Bigl[&amp;\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S\\lor\nx\\in\\Gamma(\\{z\\in\\omega\\mid\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\})\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n(P,R,S)=(P_\\Gamma,R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall P\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\;\\forall R,S\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega^2)\\quad\n\\Bigl(\\Bigl[&amp;\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega(P,R,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in S\\lor\nx\\in\\Gamma(\\{z\\in\\omega\\mid\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in S\\})\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n(P,R,S)=(P_\\Gamma,R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Theorem 13.2.2。存在性由入层范数的满射性、阶段比较的范数刻画及 (13.7) 得到。唯一性实质依赖范数满射与严格比较的良基性；只给任意两个满足固定点等式的关系，不能得到此结论。</p>\n<p>已核原书 p.337–338 的完整证明。对候选预良序的满射范数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:P\\to\\lambda\">\\(f:P\\to\\lambda\\)</span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(y)\">\\(f(y)\\)</span> 归纳，固定点等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{f(y)}=\\{z:zRy\\}\">\\(\\Gamma^{f(y)}=\\{z:zRy\\}\\)</span>；较早层之并为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{z:zSy\\}\">\\(\\{z:zSy\\}\\)</span>。从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"yRy\">\\(yRy\\)</span> 得最早入层范数不大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(y)\">\\(f(y)\\)</span>；若严格小于，则范数满射选到较小层的元素，与同一截面等式矛盾。随后按实际入层范数归纳，得到全部实际入层元素属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>，于是两载体、范数和关系相同。</p>\n<p>上述证明中的阶段均有本地定义：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(P\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 满射，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 可数，小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>。空载体对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=0\">\\(\\lambda=0\\)</span>，原证明的空归纳仍适用。此处核验是对书中数学证明及记号转换的核对，不是机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-inductive-norm","status":"resolved","id":"03fd31ede57cedbe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-inductive-norm]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-stage-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"267d66ca73221e94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-stage-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-prewellordering","status":"resolved","id":"b8684802726abc97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-prewellordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-inductive-norm","status":"resolved","id":"03fd31ede57cedbe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$。$P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-inductive-norm]]；$R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-stage-comparison]]；$\\operatorname{PreWO}_\\omega$ 与 $\\operatorname{Norm}_\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-prewellordering]]。量化的候选 $P$ 是 $\\omega$ 的子集，$R,S$ 是 $\\omega$ 上的二元关系；不假定 $\\Gamma$ 单调。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-stage-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"267d66ca73221e94","a